{
  "chapter_id": "ch_0001",
  "total_duration_ms": 839428.299319728,
  "tts_engine": "index_tts_2_5",
  "used_fallback": false,
  "items": [
    {
      "seg_id": 1,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "矿钉尖抵住岩缝时，苏砚先侧耳听了三息。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/604c988dbf9572472c9cc0dc2ed44637.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 0.0,
      "duration_ms": 4748.480725623583,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 2,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "头顶岩层沉默，远处主巷偶尔传来矿车碾轨的闷响。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/aff777a9cf41b6863a890b504ed1aa31.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 4948.480725623583,
      "duration_ms": 4702.040816326531,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 3,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "三息过后，除了水珠滴落积洼的轻响，别无异动。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/c039612ef97872ba9dd4c217de754837.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 9850.521541950115,
      "duration_ms": 5503.1292517006805,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 4,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "他沉下肩，把矿钉又送了半寸。",
      "emotion": "serious",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/8c6d6729843c57aa73545f5f813943b8.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 15553.650793650795,
      "duration_ms": 3390.1133786848072,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 5,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "这条支洞高不到五尺，人得一直弓着背。苏砚弓惯了——十六岁的人，脊背在矿下弓了十年，早弯成一张蓄力的弓。哪里该低头、哪段该屏息，他清楚得很：第三块支木上方渗水，经过时压低矿灯，别让水珠溅进灯罩；再往前七步，顶板一片风化岩，呼吸得放轻，怕气流惊了浮石。支木的腐朽气混着火药残味，钻进鼻子就没散过，早分不清是矿的还是自己身上的。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/605d2c301893f40e75f8f67837ad22d3.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 19143.764172335603,
      "duration_ms": 26067.02947845805,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 6,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "他今天还差得远。",
      "emotion": "sad",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/8f040c700aaa6084ce357c88db87640e.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 45410.793650793654,
      "duration_ms": 3471.3832199546487,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 7,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "心里那本账一天没停过：这几天攒的碎灵石，凑不齐娘的一副止咳散；那药一天都断不得，断一夜她就咳血，咳到最后熬不过这个冬天。",
      "emotion": "sad",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/069df010c86652abd50657b13de5e8eb.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 49082.1768707483,
      "duration_ms": 18123.174603174604,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 8,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "矿灯昏黄，光晕只够照亮身前一臂的岩面。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/6a4528b7f1e8323c17e90b7e86fb0d67.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 67405.3514739229,
      "duration_ms": 4342.131519274377,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 9,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "苏砚左手心里躺着三枚废灵石，前半个时辰的成果，棱角硌着茧子。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/74bbd7ef2843d55a06be1104b64de093.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 71947.48299319728,
      "duration_ms": 6629.297052154195,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 10,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "灰扑扑的，像被火烤过的石灰，表面布满细密孔洞，分量却实打实，每枚半两重，攥紧了压手腕。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/9f6349ac20e9f7898281a27081ed88d8.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 78776.78004535148,
      "duration_ms": 7546.485260770975,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 11,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "苏砚抿住嘴，右手握紧矿钉柄，手腕一拧，撬刃咬进岩缝深处。",
      "emotion": "serious",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/091ce9e34706893cb4900f9e2415e0c0.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 86523.26530612246,
      "duration_ms": 6222.947845804988,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 12,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "岩层发出极轻的裂响。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/583bc775bff0d4125dc6402f0f576d72.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 92946.21315192744,
      "duration_ms": 3030.204081632653,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 13,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "苏砚停住，等颤动过去，才继续加力——撬石不能急，急则力散，还容易带下浮石。",
      "emotion": "serious",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/d4c1391c37f616ad5d1803d085611faa.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 96176.41723356009,
      "duration_ms": 9299.591836734693,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 14,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "他十年练出的手劲顺着钉柄一丝丝透进去，力道从脚底起，过腰脊，达腕指。",
      "emotion": "calm",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/ee040e9261d3a688659acd50d0c6dc2f.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 105676.00907029478,
      "duration_ms": 7383.9455782312925,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 15,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "碎屑簌簌落了他一肩膀。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/a8b9a393a0d6ebbc797af6d0b440b7f8.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 113259.95464852607,
      "duration_ms": 3227.573696145125,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 16,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "岩缝里终于滑出一枚废灵石，拇指大小，嵌在黑褐色矿脉夹层里。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/a8691fee66813a093b30d34096377b80.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 116687.52834467118,
      "duration_ms": 6106.8480725623585,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 17,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "他用指节叩出来，掌心掂了掂。",
      "emotion": "calm",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/3581d87edcc4d800190d23f5ef1e4fc9.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 122994.37641723354,
      "duration_ms": 3227.573696145125,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 18,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "第四枚。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/b300bdafb51d9aafce9ebc23181667c8.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 126421.95011337865,
      "duration_ms": 1509.2970521541952,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 19,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "他直起腰，在狭窄支洞里换口气，矿灯照向更深处。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/3d32849decae3695a24fb0307a4ab9e1.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 128131.24716553286,
      "duration_ms": 4992.2902494331065,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 20,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "灯油还够半个时辰，再往前摸两丈，那里有个盯了半个月的凹陷，岩纹泛着暗青，兴许还能再出几枚。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/e474f5e404f3ada34c144bb0e54af20e.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 133323.53741496598,
      "duration_ms": 9624.671201814059,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 21,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "苏砚把废灵石揣进贴身布袋，束紧袋口，把矿钉顺手别回腰后，弓着背往黑暗里走去。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/019c72caa2a834326eed3254cd2e8fc1.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 143148.20861678003,
      "duration_ms": 8185.034013605442,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 22,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "那处凹陷没让他空手，后半个时辰又磕出五枚。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/c07f4443a9f9d0306a8068eea122c48b.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 151533.24263038547,
      "duration_ms": 4191.201814058957,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 23,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "收工时布袋沉甸甸的，一天下来九枚，四两五钱。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/a3206fd04cb7a77a3b9e6180d7dc1219.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 155924.44444444444,
      "duration_ms": 4551.111111111111,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 24,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "日头偏西时，苏砚排在征收点的队伍里。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/3e32e218e905488610a3f1107ee1331f.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 160675.55555555556,
      "duration_ms": 3831.2925170068024,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 25,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "征收点搭在主井口外，三张木桌拼成一排，后面坐着书办和矿丁。最中间坐着马铁秤，方脸阔额，手里那杆秤用了二十年，秤砣底下像生了根。队伍里十几个矿工，大多衣衫褴褛，脸上带着同一种表情——不是期盼，是盘算，盘算今天又能被克扣几成。地上积水映着暮色，空气里飘着汗酸和劣质烟草的气味。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/13aa6e1b6b66c7f021609071f2261043.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 164706.84807256237,
      "duration_ms": 21910.65759637188,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 26,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "苏砚前面是个五十来岁的老矿工，佝偻着背，交了六枚废灵石。马铁秤往秤盘上一丢，秤杆翘起，书办报数：",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/523de5dbd2ae1ca907aada744e447161.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 186817.50566893426,
      "duration_ms": 7778.684807256236,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 27,
      "speaker": "shu_ban",
      "text": "四钱半。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/dca0525d9bb5174d370e4fd44f5d3fc9.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 194796.1904761905,
      "duration_ms": 1834.3764172335602,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 28,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "老矿工膝头一软，就要往下跪——在这队伍里，跪下磕个头讨情，是想讨回克扣的老规矩。可马铁秤眼皮都没抬。那一跪没跪成，老矿工只滚出一声含糊的应和，接了一枚碎灵石和几分记账，缩着肩膀走了。马铁秤拇指在秤杆底下一托，半两就能变四钱半，谁都看得见，谁都当看不见——这杆秤后头站着黑石会，矿上没人敢作声。",
      "emotion": "serious",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/0a5ee981421d372d22f9c05cfcce8b82.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 196830.56689342405,
      "duration_ms": 23361.90476190476,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 29,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "轮到苏砚了。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/7e8630694581941e4eeba9bb51071545.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 220392.47165532882,
      "duration_ms": 2113.0158730158732,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 30,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "按矿上的暗规，三两废灵石折一枚碎灵石，管事那手压秤之外，账面上还得再刮一道。",
      "emotion": "serious",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/ae310e8c5a956f5441b402884d307922.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 222705.4875283447,
      "duration_ms": 8777.142857142857,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 31,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "苏砚今日撬了四两五钱，摆上桌时擦得干干净净。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/6d99cb5753fcce49922daea0552c8fe7.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 231682.63038548757,
      "duration_ms": 5061.950113378684,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 32,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "马铁秤眼皮不抬，往秤盘里一搁，秤杆沉了沉，拇指习惯性地在秤杆底下蹭了一下，又蹭了一下。",
      "emotion": "calm",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/51f3adf2a062dc8937876fb7bdafa9cd.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 236944.58049886627,
      "duration_ms": 8695.873015873016,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 33,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "苏砚右手垂在身侧，食指在裤缝上无意识地敲出三短一长。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/db1c91ef8708674149a31d1a2387ca4d.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 245840.4535147393,
      "duration_ms": 5224.489795918367,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 34,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "那是矿下数岩层的节奏，遇到算账推演时，手指自己就动起来。",
      "emotion": "calm",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/bf3ba09ab4c64f9c1830ab0a1fe35bd7.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 251264.94331065766,
      "duration_ms": 6420.31746031746,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 35,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "马铁秤抬眼，眼缝里没温度",
      "emotion": "serious",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/00b6c3834d7f199c610b0d48680db829.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 257885.26077097512,
      "duration_ms": 3506.2131519274376,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 36,
      "speaker": "ma_tie_cheng",
      "text": "四两五，按规矩该一枚半。今儿这批次，按一枚算，三成记账。",
      "emotion": "serious",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/fadc429620a8145acee399e884729a7d.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 261591.47392290254,
      "duration_ms": 8382.403628117914,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 37,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "苏砚看得清清楚楚马铁秤拇指在秤杆底下使的劲。",
      "emotion": "serious",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/4ee6bdcafaddf81cda55c7bd1dc40d95.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 270173.8775510205,
      "duration_ms": 5584.399092970521,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 38,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "三成记账，便是这一枚碎灵石只有七成当场落手，剩下的三成记在账上，日后从月头工钱里慢慢扣。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/61902a8b1b6d82467f74a9f11f9d4c83.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 275958.276643991,
      "duration_ms": 7778.684807256236,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 39,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "他张了张嘴，把话咽了回去。",
      "emotion": "sad",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/6cd26e3dad8bc622791581e4691e230a.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 283936.9614512472,
      "duration_ms": 4028.662131519274,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 40,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "手指在裤缝边极快地敲着：硬顶，就会被记名，明天就被派去“鬼见愁”矿层，上月硬顶的老刘就是去了那儿再没上来；他上不来，娘的药就得断；挨顿打下不了床，连明天的口粮都没了。",
      "emotion": "afraid",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/939365aa5ab951760bb09321e69208ab.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 288165.6235827665,
      "duration_ms": 17089.886621315192,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 41,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "忍了，少挣一日，饭碗还在，药能续。",
      "emotion": "calm",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/a7175dd4bae8cb4d2da4b35b680669fc.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 305455.5102040817,
      "duration_ms": 3703.5827664399094,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 42,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "他低下头，双手接住马铁秤丢过来的一枚碎灵石",
      "emotion": "calm",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/453df3402eb204a3cb67307fa8f79b8d.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 309359.0929705216,
      "duration_ms": 4748.480725623583,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 43,
      "speaker": "lin_dong",
      "text": "谢马管事",
      "emotion": "calm",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/19396b531fb42a46facadf8e43aa3c9b.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 314307.5736961452,
      "duration_ms": 1857.5963718820863,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 44,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "马铁秤没再看他，扭头冲台边书办，鼻子里哼出一声冷笑：",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/e39b5e400e11994651fd3a9ff16cf296.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 316365.1700680273,
      "duration_ms": 5305.759637188209,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 45,
      "speaker": "ma_tie_cheng",
      "text": "看他跪不跪。",
      "emotion": "angry",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/3964eda5b6d4889d80852fb5dbf04779.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 321870.9297052155,
      "duration_ms": 1706.6666666666667,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 46,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "周围静了一瞬。几个矿工扭过脸去。苏砚没跪，也没接话。他右手无意识地转了一下左手腕上那根褪色的旧绳——母亲柳禾早年编的，磨得起毛，早看不出原本的颜色——转了两圈，停住。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/80fadee23973ae87a3dfa8d4ff2876d3.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 323777.5963718822,
      "duration_ms": 13409.52380952381,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 47,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "一枚碎灵石攥在掌心，轻得发虚。",
      "emotion": "sad",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/d1576cf9ba61999045eda37ebc467d9d.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 337387.120181406,
      "duration_ms": 5700.498866213152,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 48,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "这羞辱是他自己咽下去的。",
      "emotion": "serious",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/b8e03e618efa8998f20deca8da80aebe.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 343287.6190476191,
      "duration_ms": 3192.743764172336,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 49,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "他心里什么都明白，只是现在还不能动。",
      "emotion": "calm",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/72d2969753bffa94052adee971c2bd9e.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 346680.3628117914,
      "duration_ms": 3947.3922902494332,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 50,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "苏砚把碎灵石揣进怀里，转身往外走。他在心里重算：今日这一枚，加上前两日攒的，还是不够一副十枚的止咳散。鬼见愁矿层还有三尺废脉，够挖半年——半年之后呢？身后又传来马铁秤喊下个人的声音：",
      "emotion": "serious",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/adfb021e22a736757a3b1ec218a0930a.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 350827.7551020408,
      "duration_ms": 15452.879818594103,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 51,
      "speaker": "ma_tie_cheng",
      "text": "愣什么？上秤！",
      "emotion": "angry",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/6a91ae0bdfdd68f8b1533fd269f03db4.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 366480.6349206349,
      "duration_ms": 2275.5555555555557,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 52,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "棚户在矿区最西边的坡底下。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/5fb79cf7c6cbbc1eaacbc788f246cf68.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 368956.1904761905,
      "duration_ms": 3308.843537414966,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 53,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "苏砚掀开油毡帘子，暮色从板壁缝隙渗进来。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/ee1c6852e57506c5b100cc55d09134ca.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 372465.03401360544,
      "duration_ms": 4388.571428571428,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 54,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "一盏油灯在陶碟里烧着，火苗被漏风扯得东倒西歪。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/2b4e8a02b8ed5117c184d0b34f41eea0.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 377053.60544217686,
      "duration_ms": 4423.401360544218,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 55,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "空气里弥漫着浓得化不开的药味，止咳散煎久了的苦香，混着草席霉味和破陶罐里的雨水味。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/15d8ca7d405c9d8c3dc6e91ed5cc9ce4.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 381677.00680272107,
      "duration_ms": 8103.764172335602,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 56,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "柳禾半倚床头，盖着薄被，脸色和土墙一个颜色。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/51cbd984b6907e37d2c1e4be9a75989a.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 389980.7709750567,
      "duration_ms": 4469.84126984127,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 57,
      "speaker": "liu_he",
      "text": "回来了？",
      "emotion": "sad",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/86c8426f2233057df9bcd8e40f52dee0.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 394650.61224489793,
      "duration_ms": 3471.3832199546487,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 58,
      "speaker": "su_yan",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/1bba2f7a6a6003aefcb8396a3e99276b.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 398321.9954648526,
      "duration_ms": 1149.3877551020407,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 59,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "苏砚把帘子压严实，走到床边，才看清娘的脸——比前些日子又瘦了，颧骨凸出来，眼窝陷下去，眼睛还亮着。她手里攥着块粗布帕子，帕角绣着朵褪色的禾苗，边缘被血渍浸成暗褐色。",
      "emotion": "sad",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/6c62a33e9c9b4e2c0f29115c9ce63cb0.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 399671.3832199546,
      "duration_ms": 25391.020408163266,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 60,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "苏砚蹲下，掏出那枚碎灵石，又摸出前两日攒下的另一枚，两枚在掌心碰了碰——手头就这些，压箱底那点钱他没敢动。",
      "emotion": "serious",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/f239827d64295f63d90614edc64fcdba.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 425262.40362811787,
      "duration_ms": 9183.492063492064,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 61,
      "speaker": "su_yan",
      "text": "药换回来了，娘放心喝。",
      "emotion": "calm",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/47402afefdaf7addf852846491d5263e.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 434645.89569160994,
      "duration_ms": 2635.4648526077094,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 62,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "他没多说，柳禾也没细问。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/cc9b1418fd9fb72d860e110d097987ad.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 437481.36054421763,
      "duration_ms": 2867.6643990929706,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 63,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "药铺的止咳散抓散的也卖，一副十枚碎灵石够吃两日，两枚只抓得回小半包。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/8e62937580bb1abe0db375eac31f58cd.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 440549.0249433106,
      "duration_ms": 7140.136054421769,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 64,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "纸包薄得透光，顶多够娘熬过今夜那两顿，明日就没了着落。",
      "emotion": "sad",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/fe4f27aae4407f73693213c56f627620.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 447889.16099773237,
      "duration_ms": 10263.219954648526,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 65,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "苏砚起身去墙角煎药。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/fe726914d4243601f1f0df705846f0f0.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 458352.3809523809,
      "duration_ms": 3227.573696145125,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 66,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "陶罐架在碎砖上，柴只剩余烬。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/71b8eeb50ccc12fb5f38b5e37a03793f.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 461779.95464852604,
      "duration_ms": 3750.0226757369614,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 67,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "他添半碗水，把止咳散撒进去，用筷子搅搅，看药末把清水染成浑浊的黄褐色。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/8824f8e1dfb3603da2d4bc731784dfc6.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 465729.977324263,
      "duration_ms": 7383.9455782312925,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 68,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "火光舔着罐底，药汤泛起气泡，苦香漫出来。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/413483078232094766bd3dd7a3f5579e.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 473313.9229024943,
      "duration_ms": 4226.0317460317465,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 69,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "煎药间隙，他蹲在火边算账。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/aa06ec4750b2cb7911972d213dfb3761.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 477739.9546485261,
      "duration_ms": 3552.6530612244896,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 70,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "一副药十枚，他一天挣一枚上下，攒齐得等半个月，娘等不起。",
      "emotion": "sad",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/fa14dbd907daca4e7612b8edcb161d86.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 481492.6077097506,
      "duration_ms": 10181.950113378685,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 71,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "药铺柜上那种断根的续命丹，一粒合三十万枚碎灵石，仙凡鸿沟另一头的价，他从没敢往那儿算。",
      "emotion": "serious",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/df858159dcd701e6f13fef95748d9473.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 491874.5578231293,
      "duration_ms": 8742.312925170068,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 72,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "压箱底那十枚救命钱，这月怕是保不住了。",
      "emotion": "afraid",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/761e0c6c12acf50950b9782e8ffa74d2.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 500816.87074829935,
      "duration_ms": 4911.0204081632655,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 73,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "他回到床边。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/4f38649878836f9a972e8cf794bd9330.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 505927.8911564626,
      "duration_ms": 1869.2063492063494,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 74,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "柳禾从枕头底下摸出一块古玉，系着根磨得发亮的旧绳。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/27ff45459a5a0c941a5eaa2b12ec2e3a.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 507997.09750566893,
      "duration_ms": 5108.390022675737,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 75,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "她摸出来的动作很慢，手指顿了顿，才递出来。",
      "emotion": "serious",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/48242245e1f3fab1924d26990d353759.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 513305.4875283447,
      "duration_ms": 4783.310657596372,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 76,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "玉是灰白色的，巴掌大小，表面刻着几道模糊纹路，看不出年代来历，只在灯底下泛着沉滞的光。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/13ac63e0d3c7570dcf51b8146ea54e72.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 518288.79818594106,
      "duration_ms": 8103.764172335602,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 77,
      "speaker": "liu_he",
      "text": "戴上。",
      "emotion": "serious",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/cf83729bafe75bd6f7ed88da3af8cbba.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 526592.5623582767,
      "duration_ms": 1753.1065759637188,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 78,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "柳禾递过来，手指枯瘦，关节肿大。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/3dbc75ccc13f2220d4a6f79d8c606e13.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 528545.6689342404,
      "duration_ms": 3065.0340136054424,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 79,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "苏砚迟疑了一瞬。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/4f1b6f5cb685eed8f87bfe95660f1c54.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 531810.7029478458,
      "duration_ms": 2914.104308390023,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 80,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "娘说过是外婆留下的，后来再没提过。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/803ef7567292de9147c36ea2935ac0e0.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 534924.8072562359,
      "duration_ms": 4307.3015873015875,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 81,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "他接过来，玉面贴着掌心，凉得像块普通石头，分量却比看起来沉。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/99e622057b3ec9266b4e1248918bee27.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 539432.1088435374,
      "duration_ms": 5665.668934240362,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 82,
      "speaker": "su_yan",
      "text": "娘，这……",
      "emotion": "surprised",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/9b304a6004f392d891f7973077cd5769.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 545297.7777777778,
      "duration_ms": 2147.845804988662,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 83,
      "speaker": "liu_he",
      "text": "别问。",
      "emotion": "serious",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/811dc126a027e0dc832bc7b543951837.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 547645.6235827664,
      "duration_ms": 1346.7573696145125,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 84,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "柳禾别过脸，咳了两声，肩头在薄被下轻颤",
      "emotion": "sad",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/4f7b6cdf33b131d70f6779ed2e97ad54.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 549192.380952381,
      "duration_ms": 8103.764172335602,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 85,
      "speaker": "liu_he",
      "text": "戴着，别摘。",
      "emotion": "serious",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/6611e1a79f4f192ee755a72d800cb05c.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 557496.1451247166,
      "duration_ms": 2635.4648526077094,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 86,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "苏砚把玉绳系在颈上，绳头在指腕上勒出一道红印。玉贴着胸口，凉意透过粗布衣裳渗进来。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/6f66d3306c837d69e75bb05baa2b1453.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 560331.6099773243,
      "duration_ms": 7906.39455782313,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 87,
      "speaker": "su_yan",
      "text": "锅里给你留着薯根粥，还温着。",
      "emotion": "calm",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/b3ef3692567e0d11df045471718c6f25.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 568438.0045351473,
      "duration_ms": 2948.934240362812,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 88,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "他说得极顺——锅里只剩半碗清汤——说完，他别开了脸，把柳禾滑落的被角掖了掖，指尖在她肩头停了一息。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/7d496b29808bc709bbc5e839d4f412f7.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 571586.9387755102,
      "duration_ms": 9020.95238095238,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 89,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "柳禾已闭上眼，呼吸浅而快，眉头还微微皱着。",
      "emotion": "serious",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/dd10044b7af54b9291d94493b780b87a.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 580807.8911564626,
      "duration_ms": 5468.299319727891,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 90,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "子夜过后，等柳禾睡沉，苏砚别上矿钉，摸进了弃矿沟。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/0e46747a75f4925f45e2a6ff0a3ab049.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 586476.1904761905,
      "duration_ms": 5387.02947845805,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 91,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "白日里在秤上被刮掉的那一截，账上还压着三成，缺口得自己想法子填。",
      "emotion": "serious",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/ef01c9d254b709642766d1a0daffa0dd.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 592063.2199546486,
      "duration_ms": 7024.036281179138,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 92,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "弃矿沟是矿区堆废石的地方，废料里总夹着没挑净的废灵石，摸黑来捡，是苏砚这些年补窟窿的老路子。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/0e10dc047f4f339f42401d7ec8195993.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 599287.2562358278,
      "duration_ms": 8986.122448979591,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 93,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "两侧岩壁笔直插进黑暗，风从沟口灌进来，带着地底阴冷。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/8ba7c6e58fc6da7c02b6b0e5e1688c67.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 608473.3786848075,
      "duration_ms": 6060.408163265306,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 94,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "他贴着沟壁往下走，每步先试落脚虚实——哪块石头稳、哪片碎石滑，都刻在身上。",
      "emotion": "calm",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/d9c1e56d7267c54fc0e93ad4c50d0f40.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 614733.7868480728,
      "duration_ms": 7500.045351473923,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 95,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "矿灯熄着。沟里不许点灯，被巡夜矿丁看见就是一顿鞭子。",
      "emotion": "serious",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/02af682f5afb528823a6948dd6a8f344.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 622433.8321995467,
      "duration_ms": 5503.1292517006805,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 96,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "苏砚摸黑走，靠手指和脚底认路。",
      "emotion": "calm",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/a91e38fd05bfcd858a694bff1c4bba4f.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 628136.9614512475,
      "duration_ms": 3506.2131519274376,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 97,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "他弯着腰，在碎石缝里翻找——废灵石和普通石灰石手感不同，更凉更沉，棱角更钝，表面细密的孔洞吸着指尖温度。",
      "emotion": "calm",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/076bbfe617b65ae2e6c9f7de0b76b4e2.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 631843.1746031749,
      "duration_ms": 10623.12925170068,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 98,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "他十年练出的手指比眼睛好使，一摸分出七八成。",
      "emotion": "calm",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/10ed469ca9e4c17d886242c352786f7b.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 642666.3038548756,
      "duration_ms": 5108.390022675737,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 99,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "一个时辰里，他摸出两枚小指大小的废灵石，藏进贴身袋里。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/8d9dd934597d42bb21a2caef6e175ed4.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 647974.6938775514,
      "duration_ms": 5584.399092970521,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 100,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "他直起腰，在沟底一块凸起的岩柱旁歇脚。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/20a88d82ec16c8626432237d394e967b.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 653759.0929705219,
      "duration_ms": 4307.3015873015875,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 101,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "手掌撑在后面的岩壁上时，指腹忽地蹭到几道又深又滑的沟槽。",
      "emotion": "surprised",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/a17ac1ff5b898affcce211e05bc939d0.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 658266.3945578234,
      "duration_ms": 8823.58276643991,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 102,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "那不是人工凿出来的开矿标记，边缘卷曲发亮，像是被大火燎烙过、又烧结了一层，他在矿下十年从未见过这种痕迹。",
      "emotion": "serious",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/515838145725fa3e75bb0a9d0e3f2d99.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 667289.9773242633,
      "duration_ms": 9856.87074829932,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 103,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "手指还停在沟槽里，他顺手解下颈上的古玉，握在掌心。",
      "emotion": "calm",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/c412ba6dfbd07975e21809f0db353dcf.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 677346.8480725626,
      "duration_ms": 5340.589569160998,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 104,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "玉在黑暗里几乎看不见。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/4b5b556e96065c4cd14a045806ecb5eb.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 682887.4376417235,
      "duration_ms": 2948.934240362812,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 105,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "苏砚用拇指摩挲玉面，那些模糊刻痕硌着指腹。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/2643b639fc7ff37f5ba8370bca231acc.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 686036.3718820864,
      "duration_ms": 4667.210884353741,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 106,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "他盯着看了几息，忽然掌心一烫——玉面泛起一点暗红，像烧过了头的炭，不闪，不亮，也不指向任何方向，只是纯粹地发热。",
      "emotion": "surprised",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/23a9f6b208c8a699ffcf98ee8774642d.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 690903.5827664401,
      "duration_ms": 12051.156462585033,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 107,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "苏砚头皮一麻，心跳猛地漏了一拍，攥玉的手骤然收紧。",
      "emotion": "afraid",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/a39dd750057e18e05b907b5fa59ff2f5.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 703154.7392290252,
      "duration_ms": 6780.2267573696145,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 108,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "恐惧攀上来的瞬间，他强行用在矿下记岩层的法子死死按住自己——那是遇到塌方征兆时，多看一眼就能活命的偏执。",
      "emotion": "serious",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/e3bb2cc31625e58079fd8122b300b65f.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 710134.9659863948,
      "duration_ms": 10332.879818594105,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 109,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "他屏住呼吸，试着用玉靠近岩壁上那几道灼烧刻痕。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/da5b8c3eea9a720de8b99ba32037c621.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 720667.8458049889,
      "duration_ms": 5061.950113378684,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 110,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "古玉贴近刻痕时，掌心烫意明显加剧；稍稍移开，那股炽热又渐渐减退。",
      "emotion": "surprised",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/96494b301928a1d62f8758d13b9ec5d5.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 725929.7959183676,
      "duration_ms": 8695.873015873016,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 111,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "他来回移动了两次，把这冷热变化记准。",
      "emotion": "calm",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/ae0da1cbe4c3b81e00b2e48cde74e4ee.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 734825.6689342406,
      "duration_ms": 3993.8321995464853,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 112,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "烫得他想松手，可也只是烫——热只在贴着玉的那块皮肤上，不往手腕走，也不驱散矿沟里半分阴冷。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/e891dd6ad9d64f61b51b2d2cc72c94f4.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 739019.5011337871,
      "duration_ms": 8823.58276643991,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 113,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "持续了几息，便开始回温，像退潮一样敛回玉身，从烫到温、到凉，最后又是块灰白石头。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/16dd5099bbb68f044d3006ebc655635e.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 748043.083900227,
      "duration_ms": 8904.85260770975,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 114,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "苏砚没出声，把玉攥在掌心，把刚才那点动静在心里从头到尾过了一遍——热来得没有预兆，是从玉心里透出来的；凑近那几道刻痕就烫得凶，手一移开又慢慢凉回去；前后不过五息、三息；没有光，没有声响，也没有气味。刻痕是什么来路、玉为什么发热，他一样都想不明白。想不明白的先搁着，跟矿下遇上说不清的岩层一个道理——记牢，回头有命再琢磨。",
      "emotion": "serious",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/b0a9fbc7643fc96459d440016e4a07c1.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 757147.9365079367,
      "duration_ms": 26914.55782312925,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 115,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "他把玉塞回衣领，凉意重新贴上胸口。指头在那根玉绳上无意识地蹭了蹭——玉没再动，凉的。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/4a0db8c39cb8cab8414992c9d4bfec29.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 784262.4943310659,
      "duration_ms": 8417.233560090703,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 116,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "就在这时，沟口上方忽然亮起一束光。是灵石灯——黑石会夜巡矿丁的家什，凡人矿工谁也点不起。白光雪亮，像一把刀切进黑暗，沿着沟壁扫下来，所过之处每块碎石都被照得惨白。",
      "emotion": "serious",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/f970a8f91689d4414ce6fdd786d20607.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 792879.7278911566,
      "duration_ms": 13293.42403628118,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 117,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "苏砚瞬间贴紧岩柱，把呼吸压到最浅，手指扣住凸起岩石，掌心被粗糙岩面硌得生疼。",
      "emotion": "afraid",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/e45ba3dfaa5acc353fd36e7011802247.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 806373.1519274377,
      "duration_ms": 9462.131519274375,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 118,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "光柱在沟底缓慢移动，照过他歇脚的岩柱——然后停住了。",
      "emotion": "serious",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/d368fe2bfcae38066b7f4eaf40c6b449.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 816035.2834467121,
      "duration_ms": 5549.569160997732,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 119,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "碎石被踩动的脚步声从沟口上方传来，由远及近。",
      "emotion": "serious",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/a1558ae399cc3c76129eace3d7c9e58d.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 821784.8526077098,
      "duration_ms": 5224.489795918367,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 120,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "那束光钉在他藏身的岩壁上，近得他能看见光晕里浮动的尘粒，看见自己的影子被钉死在岩面上。",
      "emotion": "afraid",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/d29f314e7a6803dd1c3d99552a831f61.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 827209.3424036282,
      "duration_ms": 9984.580498866213,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 121,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "没有移开。",
      "emotion": "serious",
      "audio_path": "audio_cache/147bd19f27bde2f6a63abf620227042d.wav",
      "start_time_ms": 837393.9229024944,
      "duration_ms": 1834.3764172335602,
      "sfx": null,
      "bgm": null,
      "cached": true
    }
  ]
}